NCT05810363.eligibility_criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* ASA Ⅰ\~Ⅲ;
* BMI was 18-28 kg/m2;
* For elective abdominal surgery under intravenous general anesthesia;
* The expected duration of anesthesia was 1 to 4 hours.

Exclusion Criteria:

